  "description": "macOS Keychain provider for OutWit.Shared.Secrets: generic passwords in the login keychain via the Security framework, replaced in place (no delete-then-add window). For user-facing applications; a daemon belongs in the System keychain, which this provider does not manage. An item added by one binary and read by another prompts — and a prompt in a service is a hang.",
